body=f'''# Major step030 - ongoing continuation and fresh validation source work

Recorded {stamp}. The owner explicitly resumed unfinished pro2 work: "{owner['owner_directive']}"

[Owner continuation](OWNER_CONTINUATION_20261003_001.json),de8f80d6, records ongoing local/private authorization with no invented overall end. Its [different directive/lineage review](owner-docs-independent-review001/INDEPENDENT_OWNER_CONTINUATION_REVIEW_001.json),56a702c2, passed that source scope only. The October2 deadline and [closeout029](../resume-2026-10-01-30h-001/30H_RESUME_CHECKPOINT_029.md) remain immutable history. Existing spent, expired and withdrawn artifacts remain unusable. There is no new actual phase lease, runtime GO, sole-executor transfer, resource lease or native quiet agreement.

Two pending reviews completed. The [compact capsule peer](capsule-design-independent-review001/INDEPENDENT_COMPACT_CAPSULE_REVIEW_001.json),007a4fa0, reproduced the closed capsule, five source reversals, Raw4 facts and exact two sibling test classes19+5. The [Design002 narrow peer](capsule-design-independent-review001/INDEPENDENT_DESIGN002_NARROW_REVIEW_001.json),c10c4e06, accepted the corrected ACK-to-BOUND-to-launcher-to-LATE-to-RootGO order, authentic filenames and seven Git metadata roles separately from four runtime files. These are static preparation acceptances, not tests or independent OS proof.

The [publication/native different review](pubnative-independent-review001/INDEPENDENT_PUBNATIVE_SOURCE_REVIEW_003.json),e080d318, refused causal test closure. B05's collection-budget case was masked by source-container-origin refusal; B15 resolved limits without demonstrating their composition before I/O. The initially reported missing-io suspicion was withdrawn after the combined import was found. All1139 payloads/912 declared pairs and35 source bytes were checked, but no target ran. A [distinct correction003 selection](pubnative-causal-tests-prep002/HANDOFF_003.md),manifest6b4b181a, now uses an authentic retained collection plus exact budget assertion, real native read/repeat and both publisher/verifier acquisition controls. It retains128 native names and29 metadata method ASTs and adds one metadata method, yielding128/30. All33 production files remain byte-exact. The first correction's appended class was moved before the unchanged main guard in a distinct selected source; earlier bytes are preserved. The correction awaits a different review; all tests remain UNRUN.

The [runtime inventory](runtime-renewal-inventory001/RUNTIME_RENEWAL_INVENTORY_001.md) confirms that a pin-only owner update would fail: old helpers embed expired dates. [Root source choice](ROOT_SOURCE_IMPLEMENTATION_CHOICE_001.json) authorizes fresh GG6 currentConsumer00524, M3 producers, Root choreography and two independently owned retained checker implementations. This covers all current24 fixtures, rather than spending another execution on the older14-only scope. Exact old test bodies, strict source/capsule roles and meaningful evidence are retained. Source authoring may derive AST/inert CodeType metadata but cannot execute target definitions, tests or operational helpers.

The ongoing master is separate from a future genuine, reviewed twelve-field finite execution lease. Its maximum43200 seconds bounds a selected action, not the owner's overall authorization. The actual lease SHA/end are None. Original context600, BOTH original ages<=90 at RootGO, resources<=60, Root450 plus after60, source/runtime/first-use guards remain. Source identity and source-peer rows must bind the entire fresh chain. MetadataCore12 retains its original fields and false operational_authority_granted flag. The metadata reviewer and BOUND/LATE reviewer are different actual agents; no Root process may impersonate them. Root physical launch attribution will be externally selected and qualified, never inferred from a file boolean or treated as a Job/OS witness.

The new harness must preserve complete bounded event/diagnostic evidence: canonical event rows<=1024 includingLF,4096 events,32 chunks<=131072 each/4MiB aggregate, receipt<=262144 and physical captures<=131072. Oversized evidence refuses; it is not silently truncated. Exact24 full test IDs, actual counts, errors and full diagnostics must reconcile. All before and after sources, parsers, source bindings and producer traces must be reviewed before taking any fresh capture. Separate RootGO is mandatory after actual before/BOUND/LATE admission.

Pro3 was directly informed of pro2's ongoing continuation. It first acknowledged no active workload under its closeout, then reported its own new next-step instruction and proposed a fresh bounded component25 scope. Root currently performs static/metadata authoring only; no test/Job/fit has launched. No Pro3 release was granted: the prior accepted-publisher prerequisite is still unmet. Pro3 can prepare fresh exact pins while Root completes that prerequisite; no old proposals, lease or native quiet are inferred. The restored monitor remains enabled and may poll; any future native quiet phase needs separate coordination.

Current live state is the closeout readback: HEAD3f74, the same two D178 changes and incomplete Gate009. No new current742/263 acceptance is claimed by this documentation. Root will complete corrected source reviews, freeze/review the complete fresh runtime chain, run meaningful current-source isolated checks, then proceed to exact integration/full QA/local release and independently admitted native recovery when all guards and ownership checks pass. Preserve attempt012/twins/existing epoch, frozen science, all history, no-public/no-push/no-replay boundaries, piped nativeGO and noNonInteractive.
'''
